/Subject (DSP56F803: The 56F803 is a member of the 56800 core-based family of processors. The 56F803 includes many peripherals that are especially useful for applications such as motion control, smart appliances, steppers, encoders, tachometers, limit switches, power supply and control, automotive control, engine management, noise suppression, remote utility metering, and industrial control for power, lighting, and automation.)
